# nr-llm landing page build output
landingpage/public/

# Spec Kit — generated, per-workstation state.
#
# Everything the Specify CLI writes is regenerated by `specify init` and by
# `specify preset add`, so committing it commits a copy that drifts from its
# source. It also pins one coding agent: `init-options.json` records the agent
# the tree was initialised for. The presets are vendored copies of
# netresearch/spec-kit-typo3 and -typo3-llm carrying no recoverable origin —
# spec-kit hardcodes `"source": "local"` in its registry regardless of whether
# a preset arrived from a catalog, a URL or a local directory.
#
# What stays versioned is what this project WROTE: `.specify/memory/constitution.md`
# and `specs/`. Setup instructions are in AGENTS.md.
.specify/*
!.specify/memory/
.specify/memory/*
!.specify/memory/constitution.md
